A24. Coolidge's first and most applauded public utterance. ~ DA
A25. What the man with the finest head of hair used. ~ WIG
A27. Settles somebody's hash. ~ DOOMS
A28. A chorus gal's dawn. ~ PM
A29. How interested parents defeat divorce. ~ ANNUL
A31. Do this and you'll even make clams open up. ~ PRY
A32. A big man from the South. ~ LEE
A33. Blots on the family escutcheon. ~ STIGMAS
A35. Wherever you play this game three balls are out. ~ PAWN
A36. Precious few of this stuff have value. ~ STONE
A37. Whom the glassware calls for when you hit the bottle. ~ POP
A39. This gives weight to stones. ~ CARET
A40. What the galleries ought to let more artists do. ~ HANG
A42. Unbalance mentally. ~ DERANGE
A44. At last, something distinctly individual. ~ ONE
A45. Many a wit hopes he's this when he's just a little wiggle. ~ WAG
A47. Small change. ~ PENCE
